# Importance-sampled GGX prefilter of a 32x32 cube map (six mips) into a 16x16 RGBA16F cube written as a
# layered storage image, one face per dispatch z.
case ibl_prefilter
shader compute/ibl_prefilter.hlsl
dispatch CSMain 2 2 6
ftolerance 0.001
uniform 0 0 : 0.5 64u 32.0 16u
texture 0 1 32x32x6 rgba16f sky(-1) mips=6 cube
sampler 0 2 linear clamp mips
image 0 3 16x16x6 rgba16f solid(0.0,0.0,0.0,0.0) out
